{"kind": "mod", "id": 1629, "name": "SPT-Korean-Project-Locale-Patcher", "slug": "spt-korean-project-locale-patcher", "teaser": "SPT Tarkov Korean Translation Project. Updated and improved missing Korean localization.", "owner_name": "Golani", "downloads": 13664, "favourites": 7, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.golani.koreanpatchfix", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Locales", "category_id": 9, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:18:09.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-08-08T02:49:30.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-08-08T02:49:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.13", "latest_version": "1.5.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Find all release versions, including a KR-only option, on our GitHub page:</strong>\n<strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/GoLani11/SPT-Korean-Project/releases\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/GoLani11/SPT-Korean-Project/releases</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> The version on this page supports both English and Korean (EN/KR). If you only need the Korean version, please use the GitHub link above.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Welcome to the SPT-Korean-Project.</strong></p>\n<p>This mod updates and improves the Korean localization for SPT.</p>\n<p><strong>How to Install:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <code>SPT_Korean_Localization_G&amp;M.zip</code> file.</li>\n<li>Extract the contents into your main SPT folder. The files should be placed as follows:\n<ul>\n<li><code>SPT/user/mods/spt_korean_localization_G&amp;M</code></li>\n<li><code>SPT/BepInEx/plugins/GoLani.KoreanModFix.dll</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Enjoy it!</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Thanks To:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Makina7</strong> — For collaborating on the localization work.</li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_b